@startuml
[*] --> New : Initial State
New --> Registered : Successful Registration
Registered --> Logged In : User Logs In
Logged In --> Booked Ticket : User Books A Ticket
Booked Ticket --> Account Managed : Payment Confirmed
Account Managed --> Logged Out : User Completes Action

Logged In -->* Check Ticket Status : User Checks Ticket Status
Logged In -->* Edit/Manage Account : User Edits/Delete Account Details

Registered --> Failed Registration : Unsuccessful Registration
Failed Registration --> New : Try Again

Booked Ticket --> Payment Confirmation : Payment Confirmed
Payment Confirmation --> Account Managed : User Can Manage Account

Account Managed --> Delete Account : User Deletes Account
Delete Account --> Logged Out : Final State

Logged Out --> [*] : Final State
@enduml
